# Build artifacts. The REPL runs via `go run ./cmd/kite`; if a binary ever
# gets built into the repo root it is a mistake, not something to commit.
/kite
*.test
*.out

# Database files produced by running the REPL or the test suite.
#
# WHY: from Phase 12 on, tests write real 4096-byte-paged files. Committing one
#      pins a file-format version into git history that the next format change
#      silently invalidates.
*.db
*.db-journal

# The sqllogictest corpus. Point the runner at a local checkout instead.
#
# WHY: BUILD_PLAN.md Phase 0 — some generated corpus files are 1.2-1.5MB each.
#      They are upstream data, not this project's source.
/corpus/
